          "response_id": "resp_617630ab-5807-4eb3-a75b-b3b652afb502",
          "answer": "**Ovation Spain DMC** is the strongest overall choice for large or international corporate events in Spain. It has offices in Madrid and Barcelona, nationwide coverage including the Balearic and Canary Islands, and established venue and supplier networks.[3]\n\nOther strong options:\n\n- **NUBA Incoming Spain** — a proven choice for premium events; it reports experience serving more than 700 corporate clients.[4]\n- **Tour Time** — suitable for end-to-end incentive trips, including itinerary design, logistics, official guides, and cultural activities.[1]\n- **Tuset DMC** — a good option for customized incentive programs and MICE events.[2]\n- **Barcelona Incentives** — particularly suitable for Barcelona-based corporate travel and smaller, specialized programs.[8]\n\n**Recommendation:** Request proposals from Ovation, NUBA, and Tour Time, then compare destination expertise, local staffing, emergency support, sustainability credentials, and total cost. For a multinational event, choose **Ovation**; for a high-end, highly personalized experience, shortlist **NUBA**.",
