          "response_id": "resp_6ed52c47-fc30-4692-8be1-bc09d8fc5cb3",
          "answer": "**Recommended DMC: Tuset DMC**\n\nTuset DMC is a strong choice for an international company’s incentive trip because it has in-house teams in **Barcelona, Madrid, and Valencia**, plus local partners in 12 additional Spanish destinations.[1] It manages the full programme—from destination and venue selection to hotels, transportation, activities, supplier coordination, and on-site delivery.[2]\n\nWhy it fits an incentive trip:\n\n- Experience with international groups and corporate incentives.[1][2]\n- Broad geographic coverage, allowing itineraries combining cities, coast, islands, or cultural destinations.[1]\n- Dedicated expertise in destinations such as Barcelona, Madrid, Valencia, and Costa del Sol.[1][3]\n- Suitable programme options ranging from city experiences and gala dinners to team activities, golf, marinas, and beachfront resorts.[3][4]\n\n**Best-fit itinerary:** Barcelona plus the Costa Brava or Madrid plus a nearby wine, heritage, or countryside destination. For a larger group seeking resort access and warm-weather activities, the Costa del Sol is particularly attractive.[3]\n\nBefore appointing them, request two or three sample programmes, references from comparable international groups, proposed local suppliers, cancellation terms, and a detailed all-in budget.",
